/**
 * @defgroup core Engine core
 * @brief Ownership and lifecycle primitives that do not depend on a backend.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup platform Platform API
 * @brief Low-level, platform-neutral process and window capabilities.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup platform_sdl SDL3 platform backend
 * @brief SDL3 implementation selected by desktop composition roots.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup render Render API
 * @brief Backend-neutral diagnostic-frame rendering and lifecycle contracts.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup render_opengl OpenGL renderer backend
 * @brief SDL/OpenGL 4.6 Core implementation of the shared Render API.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup world_format Runtime world format
 * @brief Versioned model and package reader shared by compiler, game, and editor.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup world_compiler World compiler
 * @brief Offline staging validation and deterministic runtime-package construction.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup game_app Game application composition
 * @brief Shared launcher surface for the game and world editor.
 */
